# UNMC

rmc-job-greeting-pve-unmc-sunriders = You are a member of the Sun Riders platoon of the United Nations Marine Corps (UNMC)!

    The Sun Riders is a small-scale and highly-trained platoon stationed aboard the UNS Endeavour, specially equipped to suit the situation at hand. From raiding enemy strongholds to clearing deadly infestations, no threat is too great for those who brave the sun.

    If you are unsure what your role does, make sure to read the player guide.

rmc-job-greeting-pve-unmc-forecon = You are a member of Force Reconnaissance (FORECON) of the United Nations Marine Corps (UNMC)!

    The Force Reconnaissance detachment aboard the UNS Rover is among the most resourceful and efficient marines the United Nations can offer. Entrusted with high-risk surveillance and reconnaissance missions with little numbers to show for it, the success of their operations depends entirely on their wits and courage.

    If you are unsure what your role does, ask the gamemaster or another player for assistance.

rmc-job-greeting-pve-spp = You are a member of the 17th Vega Naval Infantry of the Socialist Progressive Peoples (SPP)!

    The 17th Vega Naval Infantry of the SSV Deyneka, while one of many infantry sections, is tasked with responding to distress calls and fulfilling the orders of High Command. With a ship built to weather any storm, the 17th carries the torch of the Socialist Progressive Peoples through the most unforgiving regions of the sector.

    If you are unsure what your role does, make sure to read the player guide.

rmc-job-greeting-pve-rcm = You are a member of Whiskey Troop of the Royal Crown Marines (RCM)!

    The Whiskey Troop of the HMS Pratchett are among the hardiest royal marines the Three Suns Empire has to offer, with it being among the longest-operating ships with minimal need to resupply. Theys stand ready for anything, ranging from humanitarian aid to delicate operations. They relentlessly march forward for the empire over which the sun never sets.

    If you are unsure what your role does, make sure to read the player guide.

rmc-job-greeting-pve-pmc = You are a member of the Azure-12 unit of the Weston-Yamada Private Military Company (We-Ya PMC)!

    Azure-12, operating out of the UNCSS Haurchefant, are the frontier arm of the Weston-Yamada Private Military Company, entrusted with maintaining order in the far reaches of the sector—and that corporate interests are maintained. The future starts with them.

    If you are unsure what your role does, make sure to read the player guide.

rmc-job-greeting-pve-clf = You are a member of the Colony Liberation Front (CLF)!

    The Colony Liberation Front is a disorganized militia made up of colony civilians of varying backgrounds. They believe that their governments no longer represent their interests and have taken up arms in the name of freedom. Endure, resist, and believe.

    If you are unsure what your role does, ask the gamemaster or another player for assistance.
